# Tesseli foundation rule

- Specs in `docs/` are authoritative.
- Keep a single Next.js + Supabase application architecture.
- Do not add Firebase/Firestore/Drive/Docs/Sheets/NotebookLM operational dependencies.
- Do not create a parallel Express/Nest backend or duplicate ORM schema.
- Reject shortcuts that violate the architecture, security model or data boundaries defined in this repository.
- Work only on the current phase. Never silently continue to the next phase.
